{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and maintain a colony of Mushrooms, keep them happy with constant parties and make sure to deploy some defenses to deal with foragers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968420/extras/a0f7e0c46a6d1f2285882536e3859cb6.poster.avif?t=1756296269\" width=780 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968420/extras/a0f7e0c46a6d1f2285882536e3859cb6.webm?t=1756296269\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968420/extras/a0f7e0c46a6d1f2285882536e3859cb6.mp4?t=1756296269\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy and place a different array of substrates in your colony, each with different properties that affect the live of the mycelium, visit the different stores that offer a variety of substrates, nutrient producers and other great additions to the colony</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968420/extras/7636aa63eea62ebff622c1c01d0a42e5.poster.avif?t=1756296269\" width=780 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968420/extras/7636aa63eea62ebff622c1c01d0a42e5.webm?t=1756296269\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968420/extras/7636aa63eea62ebff622c1c01d0a42e5.mp4?t=1756296269\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accept requests from different mushroom that want to join your colony, each with different substrate required so, select where they should establish some roots!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968420/extras/09da97a0cde2087636f30da5a281d1d7.poster.avif?t=1756296269\" width=780 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968420/extras/09da97a0cde2087636f30da5a281d1d7.webm?t=1756296269\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968420/extras/09da97a0cde2087636f30da5a281d1d7.mp4?t=1756296269\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take care of your Mushroom by keeping them happy with parties and level them up by giving them some tasty nutrients!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968420/extras/7fcc8cf1cce7fe21f9e78deaca4aa67f.poster.avif?t=1756296269\" width=780 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968420/extras/7fcc8cf1cce7fe21f9e78deaca4aa67f.webm?t=1756296269\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968420/extras/7fcc8cf1cce7fe21f9e78deaca4aa67f.mp4?t=1756296269\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These pesky guys mean trouble, they will simply pluck your Mushroom from their homes! But that is ok, the mycelium lives on, for a time. In any case, make sure to hire some muscle and add some defensive upgrades!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968420/extras/f38dfffcefc963e8b3ee75400ee4cf98.poster.avif?t=1756296269\" width=640 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968420/extras/f38dfffcefc963e8b3ee75400ee4cf98.webm?t=1756296269\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968420/extras/f38dfffcefc963e8b3ee75400ee4cf98.mp4?t=1756296269\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo contains the content from the starting area, other areas are unlock able to give the colony more room, but the content unlocks are not included. What is included:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fourth of the total Mushrooms you can accept into your colony and about half the total of defense Mushrooms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only 2 forager types</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First area Npcs, i.e. unlocked Npcs have no functionality</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Limited amount of party and mini rhythm songs</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3968420?t=1756296269","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3968420?t=1756296269","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968420/489541c750afcbb0f043736a338c41b261ac77c7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756296269","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968420/489541c750afcbb0f043736a338c41b261ac77c7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756296269","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stats","id":15}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and 